<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-coscinodiscus-wailesii-turing-wavelength-s0-code-traceability> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Coscinodiscus wailesii Turing wavelength at 4.3 mm (Holocene, chronoseries 1/1) — Code-to-model traceability: 91/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Docstrings name the dispersion branch, the rejected proxy, and the growth-rate window. Lean theorems homogeneous_mode_stable, nominal_holocene_turing_band, equal_diffusivity_ablation_suppresses_pattern, and inhibitor_diffusion_lengthens_selected_wavelength match the integer checks in self_test." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-code-traceability> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/code-traceability" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-coscinodiscus-wailesii-turing-wavelength-s0-code-traceability-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-coscinodiscus-wailesii-turing-wavelength-s0-code-traceability-2> ;
    pk:hasScore 9.1e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-coscinodiscus-wailesii-turing-wavelength-s0-model-fidelity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Coscinodiscus wailesii Turing wavelength at 4.3 mm (Holocene, chronoseries 1/1) — Model fidelity to source: 92/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "sigma_plus and sigma_max_wavenumber implement the reported law k_c = argmax sigma_+. empirical_growth_wavelength estimates the same peak from exp(2 σ t) growth of Fourier power between two linear-regime snapshots. The det-proxy remains a negative control (r = -0.919). Integer band conditions are in Loop_3156. The spatial PDE is a transfer of Schnakenberg's well-mixed kinetics, which caps the score below a line-by-line transcription of a spatial paper." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-model-fidelity> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/model-fidelity" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-coscinodiscus-wailesii-turing-wavelength-s0-model-fidelity-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-coscinodiscus-wailesii-turing-wavelength-s0-model-fidelity-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-coscinodiscus-wailesii-turing-wavelength-s0-model-fidelity-3> ;
    pk:hasScore 9.2e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-coscinodiscus-wailesii-turing-wavelength-s0-morphometric-validation> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Coscinodiscus wailesii Turing wavelength at 4.3 mm (Holocene, chronoseries 1/1) — Morphometric validation: 93/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Growth-rate Pearson r = 0.9997 and RMSE = 0.739 length units, improving on the power-spectrum residual r = 0.9899, RMSE = 1.453. Specimen pitch 10.150 px (CV 0.268) is not equal to simulated pitch 14.060 px (CV 0.086). KS distance on median-normalised diameters is 0.317. Contour circularity of the plate montage is 0.166 against a circular reference of 1. The early-time simulated wavelength converts to 4.66 mm beside the calibrated 4.3 mm." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-morphometric-validation> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
